----
:'''Cyrene:''' I'll tell you the story of this thousand-year journey. That way, it won't just be my memories alone.
:'''Cyrene:''' And I'll share the moments I spent with (Trailblazer) with everyone. That way, the path we walked becomes a memory shared by all.
:'''Cyrene:''' People will know that there's nothing left to chase. Amphoreus has already welcomed the {{Rubi|dawn|Deliverer beyond the sky}} foretold in prophecy.
:'''Cyrene:''' Just like I said, this should be easier than last time, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thank you. You've all sacrificed so much.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sorry I'm late...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I won't let everyone's faith in me go to waste.
:'''Cyrene:''' I wonder what kind of expression is (Trailblazer) is wearing right now? Probably the same as always: calm, resolute, and brimming with confidence.
:'''Cyrene:''' If I have the chance... I'd love to see it again.
:'''Cyrene:''' Because... it's really been far too long since we parted.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Cyrene... even you...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this... all a memory?
:'''Cyrene:''' Someone as sharp as (Trailblazer) must've realized by now that this isn't reality, but a maze of Time.
:'''Cyrene:''' As the last link in the relay, I will return to the Temple of the Three Fates, tell Oronyx all of our stories, and bottle every page we've written into the little flask of "memories"...
:'''Cyrene:''' And then... may it set sail in peace... Drift down the river of time along with the Coreflame of Worldbearing, reach (Trailblazer)'s side, and lead you back to Amphoreus.
:'''Cyrene:''' Just like the first time we met, right?
:'''Cyrene:''' Even though this cycle has no demigod of Time, Time has always stood on humanity's side.
:'''Cyrene:''' This is the only way to make sure that the "Era Nova" won't happen before (Trailblazer) returns...
:'''Cyrene:''' And the only way I can safely entrust the completed final Flame-Chase Journey to the Deliverer's heart.
:'''Cyrene:''' After all, the new world will be born from your "memories," and the protagonist of this story... mustn't be absent.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} As promised, I'm back.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go. It's time to complete the "Era Nova."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I will take all of you to the new world.
:'''Cyrene:''' I believe (Trailblazer) will never let us down... just like always.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

