::'''Cyrene Etched in Memory:''' No matter how long it takes, it's okay. Waiting is what I do best.
::'''Cyrene Etched in Memory:''' After all, it took 33 million cycles for (Trailblazer) to arrive in our world... What's a few moments more?
{{Dialogue End}}

